{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>由Tambouille開發的《Sol Cesto》現於Epic Games平台限時免費，香港時間8月6日23:00截止。這是一款瘋狂無比的輕度Rogue遊戲，考驗玩家的戰術策略，帶領英雄深入隨機地下城，面對命運的無情考驗。</p>\n<p>遊戲中，你必須在隨機生成的地城內做出抉擇，每個決定都將帶來相應後果。選擇不同英雄，體驗多樣玩法，在變幻莫測的命運中求生。簡單直覺的戰鬥與高隨機性，讓每次冒險都充滿新鮮感。</p>\n\n<img alt=\"【PC】奇幻史詩風作品　《Sol Cesto》限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Sol-Cesto-A7x54.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"【PC】奇幻史詩風作品　《Sol Cesto》限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Sol-Cesto-1ya91.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"【PC】奇幻史詩風作品　《Sol Cesto》限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Sol-Cesto-1b2jb.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"【PC】奇幻史詩風作品　《Sol Cesto》限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Sol-Cesto-11xx1.jpg\"/>\n<p>遊戲名稱：Sol Cesto<br/>支援平台：Windows<br/>領取位置：Epic Games</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-30T19:58:06.013155+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":241,"images":4,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}